@lang en
IMPORT `bvvcx-p2-duties`

-- Part III, Articles 10-11: what is covered, and what is excluded. These are the BASE rules;
-- the supplementary clauses of Part IV (bvvcx-p4-supplementary.l4) cancel three of the
-- exclusions and add two heads of cover, and bvvcx-claim.l4 puts the two together.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/baoviet-vcx-2021.txt.

§ `Part III — Specific provisions`

-- src:422 | PHẦN III: QUY ĐỊNH CỤ THỂ

§§ `Article 10 — Scope of cover`

-- src:423 | Điều 10. Phạm vi bảo hiểm
-- src:424 | 10.1 BẢO VIỆT chịu trách nhiệm bồi thường cho Người được bảo hiểm những thiệt hại
-- src:425 | vật chất do thiên tai, tai nạn bất ngờ, không lường trước được trong những trường
-- src:426 | hợp sau:
-- src:427 | 10.1.1 Đâm va, lật, đổ, lệch trọng tâm, chìm, rơi toàn bộ xe; bị các vật thể khác từ bên
-- src:428 | ngoài rơi, va chạm vào;
-- src:429 | 10.1.2 Hỏa hoạn, cháy, nổ;
-- src:430 | 10.1.3 Những tai họa bất khả kháng do thiên nhiên gây ra;
-- src:431 | 10.1.4 Mất toàn bộ xe do trộm, cướp;
-- The heads of cover a loss can fall under. The last two are added by Part IV and are
-- declared here so that one type names every head.
DECLARE `A head of cover` IS ONE OF
    `10.1.1 collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck from outside`
    `10.1.2 conflagration, fire or explosion`
    `10.1.3 a natural catastrophe beyond human control`
    `10.1.4 loss of the whole vehicle by theft or robbery`
    `BVVC03 water damage to the engine or electrical system`
    `BVVC04 theft or robbery of parts`

@ref Rules, Article 10.1.1 (src 427-428)
GIVEN `the peril` IS A `A peril`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`10.1.1 — a collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck` `the peril` MEANS
    elem `the peril` (LIST `a collision`, `overturning`, `toppling over`, `a shift of the centre of gravity`,
                           `sinking`, `the whole vehicle falling`,
                           `being struck by an object falling or hitting it from outside`)

-- A physical explosion is outside definition 10 and so outside 10.1.2.
@ref Rules, Article 10.1.2 (src 429); Part I definitions 3 and 10 (src 56-57, 75-77)
GIVEN `the peril` IS A `A peril`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`10.1.2 — a conflagration, fire or explosion` `the peril` MEANS
        `the peril` EQUALS `a conflagration`
    OR  `a fire within definition 3` `the peril`
    OR  `an explosion within definition 10` `the peril`

-- 10.1.4 names theft and robbery only. Taking by fraud or abuse of trust is not theft or
-- robbery in the Rules' own vocabulary (11.15 names it separately), so it is not under
-- 10.1.4 (fork F25).
@ref Rules, Article 10.1 (src 424-431)
GIVEN `the peril` IS A `A peril`
GIVETH A MAYBE `A head of cover`
`10.1 — the head of cover for` `the peril` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `10.1.1 — a collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck` `the peril`
            THEN JUST `10.1.1 collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck from outside`
        IF `10.1.2 — a conflagration, fire or explosion` `the peril`
            THEN JUST `10.1.2 conflagration, fire or explosion`
        IF `the peril` EQUALS `a natural catastrophe beyond human control`
            THEN JUST `10.1.3 a natural catastrophe beyond human control`
        IF `the peril` EQUALS `theft of the whole vehicle` OR `the peril` EQUALS `robbery of the whole vehicle`
            THEN JUST `10.1.4 loss of the whole vehicle by theft or robbery`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- The chapeau: material damage from natural disasters and SUDDEN, UNFORESEEABLE accidents,
-- in the cases listed. The suddenness requirement is applied to every listed case,
-- consistent with Article 16(5) of the Law (aid, lines 407-408) (fork F4). The closing
-- sentence (src 438-439) says the insurer is not liable for any other cause: a loss with no
-- head here is not covered by the base Rules.
@ref Rules, Article 10.1 (src 424-431, 438-439)
GIVEN `the event` IS AN `The event`
GIVETH A MAYBE `A head of cover`
`10.1 — the head of cover for the event` `the event` MEANS
    IF   `the event`'s `sudden and unforeseeable`
    THEN `10.1 — the head of cover for` (`the event`'s `what happened`)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- src:432 | 10.2 Ngoài số tiền bồi thường, BẢO VIỆT còn thanh toán cho Người được bảo hiểm
-- src:433 | những chi phí cần thiết và hợp lý để thực hiện các công việc theo yêu cầu và chỉ dẫn
-- src:434 | của BẢO VIỆT khi xảy ra thiệt hại thuộc phạm vi bảo hiểm, bao gồm các chi phí:
-- src:435 | 10.2.1 Chi phí ngăn ngừa hạn chế thiệt hại phát sinh thêm;
-- src:436 | 10.2.2 Chi phí cứu hộ và vận chuyển xe bị thiệt hại tới nơi sửa chữa gần nhất tối đa
-- src:437 | không vượt quá mười phần trăm (10%) số tiền bảo hiểm của xe đó.
-- On top of the compensation: costs incurred at the insurer's request and on its direction
-- for a covered loss — preventing further damage, and rescue and transport to the nearest
-- repairer, the latter capped at 10% of the sum insured. Nothing else caps them; they are
-- outside "the compensation" that 12.4 caps and Article 15 reduces (fork F27).
@ref Rules, Article 10.2.2 (src 436-437)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`10.2.2 — the cap on rescue and transport, as a share of the sum insured` MEANS 10%

@ref Rules, Article 10.2 (src 432-437)
GIVEN `the expenses`    IS A `The expenses`
      `the sum insured` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`10.2 — the expenses payable from` `the expenses` `with sum insured` `the sum insured` MEANS
    IF   `the expenses`'s `incurred at the insurer's request and on its direction`
    THEN     `the expenses`'s `cost of preventing further damage`
         PLUS min (`the expenses`'s `cost of rescue and of transport to the nearest repairer`)
                  (`10.2.2 — the cap on rescue and transport, as a share of the sum insured` TIMES `the sum insured`)
    ELSE 0

-- src:438 | BẢO VIỆT không chịu trách nhiệm bồi thường cho những thiệt hại do các nguyên nhân
-- src:439 | nằm ngoài các trường hợp đã liệt kê tại khoản 10.1 điều này.

§§ `Article 11 — Exclusions`

-- src:440 | Điều 11. Loại trừ trách nhiệm bảo hiểm
-- src:441 | BẢO VIỆT không bồi thường thiệt hại trong các trường hợp sau:
-- The exclusions as named outcomes. 11.1-11.9, 11.14, 11.15 and 11.16 are about the event
-- and defeat the whole claim; 11.10-11.13 and 11.17 are about a damaged part and remove that
-- part. None of them asks whether the excluded fact caused the loss (finding X2).
DECLARE `An exclusion of Article 11` IS ONE OF
    `11.1 deliberate damage`
    `11.2 no valid inspection certificate`
    `11.3 no proper driving licence`
    `11.4 alcohol or drugs`
    `11.5 wrong way, prohibited turn, traffic signals, or no lights at night`
    `11.6 racing or unlawful towing`
    `11.7 dangerous goods without a permit`
    `11.8 outside Vietnam`
    `11.9 war or terrorism`
    `11.10 wear and tear, inherent nature, loss of value, defect, or repair`
    `11.11 electrical damage to electrical equipment`
    `11.12 water damage to the engine or electrical system while operating in a flooded area`
    `11.13 tyres, tarpaulins or labels damaged alone`
    `11.14 theft or robbery of parts`
    `11.15 loss of the whole vehicle by fraud or abuse of trust`
    `11.16 overloading by 50% or more`
    `11.17 added equipment`

§§ `The person driving and the driver`

-- Exclusions written about "the driver" (Người điều khiển xe, definition 8) reach only a
-- person driving with the purchaser's or the insured's consent. Limbs with no subject
-- ("driving into a one-way road against the traffic", "racing") are read as about whoever
-- drove (fork F5).
GIVEN `the driving` IS A `The driving`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the person driving was the driver of definition 8 in` `the driving` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the driving`'s `the person driving`
    WHEN NOTHING             THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST `the person`   THEN `the driver within definition 8` `the person`

§§ `11.1 — deliberate damage`

-- src:442 | 11.1 Hành động cố ý gây thiệt hại của Bên mua bảo hiểm, Người được bảo hiểm, Người
-- src:443 | điều khiển xe và những người có quyền lợi liên quan đến sở hữu, khai thác và sử
-- src:444 | dụng xe;
@ref Rules, Article 11.1 (src 442-444)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.1 — deliberate damage by the purchaser, the insured, the driver, or a person with an interest` `the claim` MEANS
        elem `the purchaser, deliberately`  `who`
    OR  elem `the insured, deliberately`    `who`
    OR  (    elem `the person driving, deliberately` `who`
         AND `the person driving was the driver of definition 8 in` (`the claim`'s `the driving`))
    OR  elem `a person with an interest in owning, operating or using the vehicle, deliberately` `who`
    WHERE
        `who` MEANS `the claim`'s `the event`'s `who acted deliberately to cause the damage`

§§ `11.2 — no valid inspection certificate`

-- src:449 | 11.2 Tại thời điểm xe ô tô xảy ra thiệt hại, xe không có Giấy chứng nhận kiểm định còn
-- src:450 | hiệu lực (Trừ trường hợp xe mới chờ đăng kiểm và không quá 30 ngày kể từ ngày
-- src:451 | bảo hiểm có hiệu lực);
-- Except a new vehicle awaiting inspection, for no more than 30 days from the day the
-- insurance took effect (the start of the period: day 30 is inside, day 31 is not).
@ref Rules, Article 11.2 (src 449-451)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`11.2 — the days of grace for a new vehicle awaiting inspection` MEANS 30

@ref Rules, Article 11.2 (src 449-451)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.2 — no valid inspection certificate at the time of the damage` `the claim` MEANS
        NOT `the status`'s `a valid inspection certificate`
    AND NOT (    `the status`'s `a new vehicle awaiting its first inspection`
             AND `the claim`'s `the event`'s `the date of the loss` AT MOST
                     `the day` `11.2 — the days of grace for a new vehicle awaiting inspection` `days after` (`the claim`'s `the policy`'s `the start of the period of insurance`))
    WHERE
        `the status` MEANS `the claim`'s `the event`'s `the inspection status`

§§ `11.3 — no proper driving licence`

-- src:452 | 11.3 Người điều khiển xe không có Giấy phép lái xe, Giấy phép lái xe hết hạn sử dụng
-- src:453 | tại thời điểm xảy ra tai nạn hoặc Giấy phép lái xe không phù hợp đối với loại xe ô
-- src:454 | tô bắt buộc phải có Giấy phép lái xe. Trường hợp Người điều khiển xe bị tước
-- src:455 | quyền sử dụng Giấy phép lái xe có thời hạn hoặc không thời hạn thì được coi là
-- src:456 | không có Giấy phép lái xe. Không áp dụng loại trừ trách nhiệm bảo hiểm khi không
-- src:457 | có Giấy phép lái xe đối với học viên học lái xe trên xe tập lái, thi tuyển lái xe trên
-- src:458 | xe sát hạch;
-- About "the driver" (definition 8). A withdrawn licence counts as none. The learner and
-- examination exception lifts only the "no licence" limb.
@ref Rules, Article 11.3 (src 452-458)
GIVEN `the person` IS A `The person driving`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.3 — the person drove without a proper licence` `the person` MEANS
        (    ((NOT `the person`'s `held a driving licence`) OR `the person`'s `the right to use the licence had been withdrawn`)
         AND NOT `the person`'s `a learner driving a training vehicle`
         AND NOT `the person`'s `a candidate driving a test vehicle in a driving examination`)
    OR  (    `the person`'s `held a driving licence`
         AND NOT `the person`'s `the right to use the licence had been withdrawn`
         AND (`the person`'s `the licence had expired` OR (NOT `the person`'s `the licence was right for the class of vehicle`)))

@ref Rules, Article 11.3 (src 452-458)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.3 — the driver had no proper licence` `the claim` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the claim`'s `the driving`'s `the person driving`
    WHEN NOTHING           THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST `the person` THEN     `the driver within definition 8` `the person`
                                AND `11.3 — the person drove without a proper licence` `the person`

§§ `11.4 — alcohol or drugs`

-- src:459 | 11.4 Người điều khiển xe lái xe trong tình trạng có nồng độ cồn vượt quá 50
-- src:460 | miligam/100 mililít máu hoặc 0,25 miligam/1 lít khí thở; Sử dụng ma túy và chất
-- src:461 | kích thích bị cấm theo quy định của pháp luật;
-- "Exceeding" 50 mg per 100 ml of blood or 0.25 mg per litre of breath ("0,25": the comma is
-- the decimal point): exactly at the figure is not excluded. A reading that was never taken
-- shows nothing (refusing to be tested is 15.1.3(b)). The alcohol limb names "the driver";
-- the drugs limb has no subject and is read as about whoever drove (fork F5).
@ref Rules, Article 11.4 (src 459-460)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`11.4 — the blood alcohol limit, milligrams per 100 millilitres` MEANS 50

@ref Rules, Article 11.4 (src 459-460)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`11.4 — the breath alcohol limit, milligrams per litre` MEANS 0.25

GIVEN `the reading` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the limit`   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a reading of` `the reading` `exceeds` `the limit` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the reading`
    WHEN NOTHING        THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST `r`       THEN `r` GREATER THAN `the limit`

@ref Rules, Article 11.4 (src 459-461)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.4 — alcohol over the limit, or prohibited drugs` `the claim` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the claim`'s `the driving`'s `the person driving`
    WHEN NOTHING           THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST `the person` THEN
            (    `the driver within definition 8` `the person`
             AND (   `a reading of` (`the person`'s `blood alcohol, milligrams per 100 millilitres`) `exceeds` `11.4 — the blood alcohol limit, milligrams per 100 millilitres`
                  OR `a reading of` (`the person`'s `breath alcohol, milligrams per litre`) `exceeds` `11.4 — the breath alcohol limit, milligrams per litre`))
        OR  `the person`'s `had used narcotics or stimulants the law prohibits`

§§ `11.5 — wrong way, prohibited turn, traffic signals, no lights`

-- src:462 | 11.5 Điều khiển xe vào đường ngược chiều (đi ngược chiều của đường một chiều, đi
-- src:463 | ngược chiều trên đường có biển “Cấm đi ngược chiều”); Điều khiển xe rẽ, quay đầu
-- src:464 | tại nơi bị cấm; Người điều khiển xe không chấp hành hiệu lệnh của đèn tín hiệu
-- src:465 | giao thông; Điều khiển xe ban đêm không có thiết bị chiếu sáng hoặc không bật
-- src:466 | thiết bị chiếu sáng theo quy định của pháp luật;
-- Four limbs; only the third names "the driver". Every limb needs someone to have been
-- driving.
@ref Rules, Article 11.5 (src 462-466)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.5 — wrong way, prohibited turn, disobeying signals, or no lights at night` `the claim` MEANS
        `someone was driving` (`the claim`'s `the driving`)
    AND (   `the manner`'s `drove the wrong way`
         OR `the manner`'s `turned or made a U-turn where that is prohibited`
         OR (    `the manner`'s `disobeyed traffic signals`
             AND `the person driving was the driver of definition 8 in` (`the claim`'s `the driving`))
         OR `the manner`'s `drove at night without lights, or without lights on as the law requires`)
    WHERE
        `the manner` MEANS `the claim`'s `the driving`'s `the manner of driving`

§§ `11.6 and 11.7 — racing, towing, dangerous goods`

-- src:467 | 11.6 Đua xe (hợp pháp hoặc trái phép); Kéo xe khác không tuân thủ quy định của pháp
-- src:468 | luật;
-- src:469 | 11.7 Chở hàng hóa nguy hiểm không có Giấy phép vận chuyển hàng hóa nguy hiểm theo
-- src:470 | quy định của pháp luật;
@ref Rules, Article 11.6 (src 467-468)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.6 — racing, or towing another vehicle unlawfully` `the claim` MEANS
        `the claim`'s `the driving`'s `the manner of driving`'s `racing, lawful or unlawful`
    OR  `the claim`'s `the driving`'s `the manner of driving`'s `towing another vehicle in breach of the law`

@ref Rules, Article 11.7 (src 469-470)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.7 — dangerous goods without a permit` `the claim` MEANS
    `the claim`'s `the driving`'s `the manner of driving`'s `carrying dangerous goods without the permit the law requires`

§§ `11.8 and 11.9 — outside Vietnam; war and terrorism`

-- src:471 | 11.8 Thiệt hại xảy ra ngoài lãnh thổ Việt Nam;
-- src:472 | 11.9 Thiệt hại xảy ra trong những trường hợp chiến tranh, khủng bố;
@ref Rules, Article 11.8 (src 471)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.8 — damage outside Vietnam` `the claim` MEANS
    NOT (`the claim`'s `the event`'s `where it happened` EQUALS `in Vietnam`)

@ref Rules, Article 11.9 (src 472)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.9 — damage in war or terrorism` `the claim` MEANS
    `the claim`'s `the event`'s `in war or terrorism`

§§ `11.14 and 11.15 — theft of parts; fraud and abuse of trust`

-- src:484 | 11.14 Mất bộ phận của xe do bị trộm hoặc bị cướp;
-- src:485 | 11.15 Mất toàn bộ xe trong trường hợp lừa đảo hoặc lạm dụng tín nhiệm chiếm đoạt xe
-- src:486 | (đối với xe cho thuê hoặc xe cho mượn hoặc siết nợ hoặc tranh chấp);
-- 11.15's parenthesis ("for a vehicle hired out or lent, or taken over a debt or a
-- dispute") is read as limiting the exclusion to those vehicles (fork F26).
@ref Rules, Article 11.14 (src 484)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.14 — theft or robbery of parts` `the claim` MEANS
        `the claim`'s `the event`'s `what happened` EQUALS `theft of parts of the vehicle`
    OR  `the claim`'s `the event`'s `what happened` EQUALS `robbery of parts of the vehicle`

@ref Rules, Article 11.15 (src 485-486)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.15 — loss of the whole vehicle by fraud or abuse of trust` `the claim` MEANS
        `the claim`'s `the event`'s `what happened` EQUALS `the whole vehicle taken by fraud or abuse of trust`
    AND `the claim`'s `the event`'s `the vehicle was hired out, lent, held for a debt, or under dispute`

§§ `11.16 — overloading`

-- src:487 | 11.16 Xe chở/kéo theo quá trọng tải hoặc quá số lượng người từ năm mươi phần trăm
-- src:488 | (50%) trở lên (không bao gồm trẻ em dưới 07 tuổi) theo quy định trên Giấy chứng
-- src:489 | nhận kiểm định (đối với xe chở hàng căn cứ vào trọng tải, xe chở người căn cứ vào
-- src:494 | số người chở trên xe, đối với xe vừa chở người vừa chở hàng căn cứ vào trọng tải
-- src:495 | hoặc số người chở trên xe);
-- 50% or more over the permitted load or the permitted number of persons (children under 7
-- not counted), by the inspection certificate: load for a goods vehicle, persons for a
-- passenger vehicle, either for a mixed one.
@ref Rules, Article 11.16 (src 487-488)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`11.16 — the overloading that excludes` MEANS 50%

GIVEN `the carried`   IS A NUMBER
      `the permitted` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the excess of` `the carried` `over` `the permitted` `, as a share of it` MEANS
    IF   `the permitted` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN max 0 ((`the carried` MINUS `the permitted`) DIVIDED BY `the permitted`)
    ELSE 0

@ref Rules, Article 11.16 (src 487-495)
GIVEN `the vehicle`      IS A `The insured vehicle`
      `the load`         IS A `The load at the time of the loss`
      `count children`   IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the overloading of` `the vehicle` `carrying` `the load` `, counting children under 7:` `count children` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the vehicle`'s `designed to carry`
    WHEN `goods`                     THEN `by load`
    WHEN `passengers`                THEN `by persons`
    WHEN `both passengers and goods` THEN max `by load` `by persons`
    WHERE
        `by load`    MEANS `the excess of` (`the load`'s `load carried or towed`) `over` (`the vehicle`'s `permitted load`) `, as a share of it`
        `persons`    MEANS IF   `count children`
                           THEN `the load`'s `persons carried, other than children under 7` PLUS `the load`'s `children under 7 carried`
                           ELSE `the load`'s `persons carried, other than children under 7`
        `by persons` MEANS `the excess of` `persons` `over` (`the vehicle`'s `permitted number of persons`) `, as a share of it`

@ref Rules, Article 11.16 (src 487-495)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.16 — overloaded by 50% or more` `the claim` MEANS
    `the overloading of` (`the claim`'s `the vehicle`) `carrying` (`the claim`'s `the event`'s `the load`) `, counting children under 7:` FALSE
        AT LEAST `11.16 — the overloading that excludes`

§§ `The exclusions about the event`

@ref Rules, Article 11 (src 440-472, 484-495)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `An exclusion of Article 11`
`Article 11 — the exclusions about the event that apply to` `the claim` MEANS
    concat (LIST
        (IF `11.1 — deliberate damage by the purchaser, the insured, the driver, or a person with an interest` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.1 deliberate damage` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.2 — no valid inspection certificate at the time of the damage` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.2 no valid inspection certificate` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.3 — the driver had no proper licence` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.3 no proper driving licence` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.4 — alcohol over the limit, or prohibited drugs` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.4 alcohol or drugs` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.5 — wrong way, prohibited turn, disobeying signals, or no lights at night` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.5 wrong way, prohibited turn, traffic signals, or no lights at night` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.6 — racing, or towing another vehicle unlawfully` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.6 racing or unlawful towing` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.7 — dangerous goods without a permit` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.7 dangerous goods without a permit` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.8 — damage outside Vietnam` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.8 outside Vietnam` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.9 — damage in war or terrorism` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.9 war or terrorism` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.14 — theft or robbery of parts` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.14 theft or robbery of parts` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.15 — loss of the whole vehicle by fraud or abuse of trust` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.15 loss of the whole vehicle by fraud or abuse of trust` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.16 — overloaded by 50% or more` `the claim` THEN LIST `11.16 overloading by 50% or more` ELSE EMPTY))

§§ `The exclusions about a damaged part`

-- src:473 | 11.10 Thiệt hại do hao mòn tự nhiên hoặc do bản chất vốn có của tài sản, giảm giá trị
-- src:474 | thương mại, hỏng hóc do khuyết tật hoặc hỏng hóc thêm do sửa chữa, trong quá
-- src:475 | trình sửa chữa (bao gồm cả chạy thử);
@ref Rules, Article 11.10 (src 473-475)
GIVEN `the part` IS A `A damaged part`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.10 — damaged by wear and tear, its nature, loss of value, a defect, or repair` `the part` MEANS
    elem (`the part`'s `cause`)
         (LIST `natural wear and tear`, `the inherent nature of the part`, `a loss of commercial value`,
               `a breakdown from a defect`, `further damage from a repair`, `damage during a repair, test runs included`)

-- src:476 | 11.11 Thiệt hại xảy ra đối với thiết bị điện, điều hoà, dụng cụ điện hay các bộ phận của
-- src:477 | thiết bị điện, điều hoà do chạy quá tải, quá áp lực, đoản mạch, tự đốt nóng, hồ
-- src:478 | quang điện hay rò điện do bất kỳ nguyên nhân nào;
@ref Rules, Article 11.11 (src 476-478)
GIVEN `the part` IS A `A damaged part`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.11 — electrical equipment damaged by overload, short circuit and the like` `the part` MEANS
        `the part`'s `kind`  EQUALS `electrical equipment, air conditioning, an electrical tool, or a part of one`
    AND `the part`'s `cause` EQUALS `overload, overpressure, short circuit, self-heating, electric arc or current leakage`

-- src:479 | 11.12 Thiệt hại hệ thống điện, động cơ khi xe hoạt động trong khu vực bị ngập nước (kể
-- src:480 | cả trường hợp trong mưa, bão, lũ lụt);
-- "While the vehicle operates in a flooded area": a vehicle standing still when the water
-- reached it is not operating, so its engine damage is not excluded here (fork F11).
@ref Rules, Article 11.12 (src 479-480)
GIVEN `the part` IS A `A damaged part`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.12 — engine or electrical system damaged while operating in a flooded area` `the part` MEANS
        elem (`the part`'s `kind`) (LIST `the engine`, `the electrical system`)
    AND `the part`'s `cause` EQUALS `water, while the vehicle was operating in a flooded area`

-- src:481 | 11.13 Thiệt hại đối với săm lốp, bạt thùng xe, nhãn mác trừ trường hợp thiệt hại xảy ra do
-- src:482 | cùng một nguyên nhân và đồng thời với các bộ phận khác của xe trong cùng một vụ
-- src:483 | tai nạn;
-- Unless damaged by the same cause and at the same time as other parts in the same accident.
-- "Other parts" is read as parts that are not themselves tyres, tarpaulins or labels: two
-- tyres damaged together do not save each other (fork F23).
GIVEN `the part` IS A `A damaged part`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a tyre, tarpaulin or label` `the part` MEANS
    elem (`the part`'s `kind`) (LIST `a tyre or inner tube`, `the tarpaulin of the cargo body`, `a label or badge`)

@ref Rules, Article 11.13 (src 481-483)
GIVEN `the part`  IS A `A damaged part`
      `the parts` IS A LIST OF `A damaged part`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.13 — a tyre, tarpaulin or label damaged alone` `the part` `among` `the parts` MEANS
        `a tyre, tarpaulin or label` `the part`
    AND NOT any (GIVEN `other` YIELD     (NOT `a tyre, tarpaulin or label` `other`)
                                     AND `other`'s `cause` EQUALS `the part`'s `cause`)
                `the parts`

-- src:496 | 11.17 Thiệt hại đối với các thiết bị lắp thêm trên xe ngoài các thiết bị của nhà sản xuất đã
-- src:497 | lắp ráp (không bao gồm các thiết bị mang tính chất bảo vệ cho xe: hệ thống báo
-- src:498 | động, cản trước, cản sau) và thiệt hại về xe ô tô do các thiết bị lắp thêm trên xe
-- src:499 | ngoài các thiết bị của nhà sản xuất đã lắp ráp gây ra trừ các thiết bị lắp thêm theo
-- src:500 | quy định.
-- Two limbs: damage TO added equipment (protective equipment — alarm, bumpers — not
-- excluded), and damage to the vehicle CAUSED BY added equipment; "save added equipment
-- fitted as the regulations provide" is read as lifting both limbs (fork F24). Which
-- regulations, the Rules do not say (finding X13).
@ref Rules, Article 11.17 (src 496-500)
GIVEN `the part` IS A `A damaged part`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`11.17 — added equipment, or damage caused by it` `the part` MEANS
        `the part`'s `kind`  EQUALS `other added equipment`
    OR  `the part`'s `cause` EQUALS `other added equipment`

@ref Rules, Article 11 (src 473-483, 496-500)
GIVEN `the part`  IS A `A damaged part`
      `the parts` IS A LIST OF `A damaged part`
GIVETH A LIST OF `An exclusion of Article 11`
`Article 11 — the exclusions that apply to` `the part` `among` `the parts` MEANS
    concat (LIST
        (IF `11.10 — damaged by wear and tear, its nature, loss of value, a defect, or repair` `the part` THEN LIST `11.10 wear and tear, inherent nature, loss of value, defect, or repair` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.11 — electrical equipment damaged by overload, short circuit and the like` `the part` THEN LIST `11.11 electrical damage to electrical equipment` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.12 — engine or electrical system damaged while operating in a flooded area` `the part` THEN LIST `11.12 water damage to the engine or electrical system while operating in a flooded area` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.13 — a tyre, tarpaulin or label damaged alone` `the part` `among` `the parts` THEN LIST `11.13 tyres, tarpaulins or labels damaged alone` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `11.17 — added equipment, or damage caused by it` `the part` THEN LIST `11.17 added equipment` ELSE EMPTY))
